            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Are you fully girded up, Traveler?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224805",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722480301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722480301": {
            "id": "722480301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Here comes one of those spirits...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480302"
            ]
          },
          "722480302": {
            "id": "722480302",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "My name is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480303"
            ]
          },
          "722480303": {
            "id": "722480303",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Aberaku, Helios-Forger!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480304"
            ]
          },
          "722480304": {
            "id": "722480304",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "How could I have been felled by your vile slander, or imprisoned by your puppet infants!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480305"
            ]
          },
          "722480305": {
            "id": "722480305",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "I— No, wait. I was imprisoned for months and years beyond count, was I not? Then... This must be my post-life form?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480306"
            ]
          },
          "722480306": {
            "id": "722480306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Post-life form\"? You mean that you're already dead, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480307"
            ]
          },
          "722480307": {
            "id": "722480307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Takes a pretty rare spirit to realize that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480308"
            ]
          },
          "722480308": {
            "id": "722480308",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "And yet, though it shames me to say so, I know not just how I died...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480309"
            ]
          },
          "722480309": {
            "id": "722480309",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "But I recall that I was imprisoned on orders from a child.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480310"
            ]
          },
          "722480310": {
            "id": "722480310",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A child?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480311"
            ]
          },
          "722480311": {
            "id": "722480311",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Indeed. But till today, I can never feel any hatred for that child, only pity.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480312"
            ]
          },
          "722480312": {
            "id": "722480312",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "He was not at fault. The blame should fall upon those who controlled him like a puppet in their palms... Forget it. Such things are best left unsaid.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480313"
            ]
          },
          "722480313": {
            "id": "722480313",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "After that, I was imprisoned...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480314"
            ]
          },
          "722480314": {
            "id": "722480314",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Imprisoned in a...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480315"
            ]
          },
          "722480315": {
            "id": "722480315",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "In a...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480316"
            ]
          },
          "722480316": {
            "id": "722480316",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "In a very high place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480317"
            ]
          },
          "722480317": {
            "id": "722480317",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "But though it was high up, it was dark, lightless, and cold as the ice itself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480318"
            ]
          },
          "722480318": {
            "id": "722480318",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "...Strange. Why is that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480319"
            ]
          },
          "722480319": {
            "id": "722480319",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Why do I feel that a high place should have brought a person warmth and comfort?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480320"
            ]
          },
          "722480320": {
            "id": "722480320",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Why... Why can't I remember any of this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480321"
            ]
          },
          "722480321": {
            "id": "722480321",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Are you hungry, maybe?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480322"
            ]
          },
          "722480322": {
            "id": "722480322",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whenever Paimon's famished, forget thinking, she can barely even talk straight!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480324",
              "722480326"
            ]
          },
          "722480324": {
            "id": "722480324",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Come on, it's gotta be! Look at him, he can hardly speak clearly!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480327"
            ]
          },
          "722480327": {
            "id": "722480327",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Actually, {NICKNAME}, could you check if there's something to eat amongst the offerings?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480328"
            ]
          },
          "722480328": {
            "id": "722480328",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Wait! That's it! The offerings!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480329"
            ]
          },
          "722480329": {
            "id": "722480329",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What, do you wanna eat them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480330"
            ]
          },
          "722480330": {
            "id": "722480330",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "No, I just remembered...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480331"
            ]
          },
          "722480331": {
            "id": "722480331",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "When I died in prison, my attire and body were enshrined in various places due to my contribution in creating the Helios.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480332"
            ]
          },
          "722480332": {
            "id": "722480332",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "But that also caused my spirit to be separated and rendered unable to rest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480333"
            ]
          },
          "722480333": {
            "id": "722480333",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "This place should have been the resting place of my sacred crown, though it has surely decayed by now. This must surely be why my thoughts are so... stuck.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480334"
            ]
          },
          "722480334": {
            "id": "722480334",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "If this persists, I doubt that even my current state can be sustained for long...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480335"
            ]
          },
          "722480335": {
            "id": "722480335",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "But these offerings can be used to replace the remnants of my body and my attire in sustaining an ounce of my thoughts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480336"
            ]
          },
          "722480336": {
            "id": "722480336",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "As such, please take them with you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480337"
            ]
          },
          "722480337": {
            "id": "722480337",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "However, there are many perils on the enshrining path. So though it may seem rude of me, could you accept a certain test first?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480338"
            ]
          },
          "722480338": {
            "id": "722480338",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Test? What test?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480339"
            ]
          },
          "722480339": {
            "id": "722480339",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Please defeat the monsters hereabouts, the prison wardens of my spirit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480340"
            ]
          },
          "722480340": {
            "id": "722480340",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "This matter is perilous. Tell me once you are ready, O Traveler, and we shall begin."
          },
          "722480326": {
            "id": "722480326",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224802",
      "subQuestName": "Activate the spirit's trial",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722480501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722480501": {
            "id": "722480501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm ready.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480502"
            ]
          },
          "722480502": {
            "id": "722480502",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Then I wish you... every success in your battle ahead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224804",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain the offerings from the spirit",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722480201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722480201": {
            "id": "722480201",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Ah, if only Byakuyakoku had such valiant warriors as you! Then...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480202"
            ]
          },
          "722480202": {
            "id": "722480202",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "*sigh* If this thing is done, then my wishes shall be fulfilled.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480203"
            ]
          },
          "722480203": {
            "id": "722480203",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "You must bring these offerings bearing my thoughts to be enshrined... in the place where I was held under arrest. We must do this, in order to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480204"
            ]
          },
          "722480204": {
            "id": "722480204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "In order to what?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480205"
            ]
          },
          "722480205": {
            "id": "722480205",
            "speakerId": 20356,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "In order to... In order to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480206"
            ]
          },
          "722480206": {
            "id": "722480206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, there's no use talking to this guy now. Seems like his spirit's all messed up again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480207"
            ]
          },
          "722480207": {
            "id": "722480207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, let's just take those items with us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480208"
            ]
          },
          "722480208": {
            "id": "722480208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But where was this high-up place where this guy was imprisoned?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7224806",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722480601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722480601": {
            "id": "722480601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I need a while more to prepare.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722480602"
            ]
          },
          "722480602": {
            "id": "722480602",
            "speakerId": 20342,
            "speakerName": "Aberaku",
            "text": "Then I shall await your tidings."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}